WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.068
Step 1. Open the appointment.

1.2
00:00:02.068 --> 00:00:06.644
You mark an appointment as no-show from Appointment Details, with a note.

1.3
00:00:06.644 --> 00:00:10.905
Select the appointment on the Appointments board to open it.

2.1
00:00:10.905 --> 00:00:13.471
Step 2. Select Mark as no-show.

2.2
00:00:13.471 --> 00:00:18.251
Select the menu button with three dots to open the Actions menu,

2.3
00:00:18.251 --> 00:00:23.382
then select Mark as no-show. The Mark as no-show dialog opens.

3.1
00:00:23.382 --> 00:00:25.126
Step 3. Enter a note.

3.2
00:00:25.126 --> 00:00:30.464
The Note field shows the appointment's current note; replace it with yours.

3.3
00:00:30.464 --> 00:00:33.809
Confirm stays disabled while the note is empty.

3.4
00:00:33.809 --> 00:00:37.155
Read the warning: this cannot be undone.

4.1
00:00:37.155 --> 00:00:39.554
Step 4. Confirm. Select Confirm.

4.2
00:00:39.554 --> 00:00:43.987
Care sets the appointment's status to No-show and saves your note,

4.3
00:00:43.987 --> 00:00:48.046
which the Note card on Appointment Details now shows.
